    When 執行 ICrawlerOrchestrator.RunAsync(new CrawlerArgs { Mode = Scheduled, TargetDate = 2026-05-08 })
    Then errors.log 應含 Severity = "error" 且 Message 包含 "No space left on device" 的 ErrorLogEntry
    And summary.json 寫入若可成功，LastRunStatus 應為 RunStatus.Failed

